    {
      "id": "RB-305",
      "title": "Disk space alerts and write failures",
      "content": "Possible causes: runaway log volume, large temp files, a stuck log rotation, data growth. Check which directory grew, the log level, and whether rotation is working."
    },
    {
      "id": "RB-007",
      "title": "General HTTP 5xx investigation checklist",
      "content": "1. Find the first error in the logs and note the time. 2. Check recent deploys of the affected service near that time. 3. Check dependencies (database, payment gateway, cache). 4. Compare error rate before and after the change."
    },
    {
      "id": "RB-210",
      "title": "Rotating the CDN signing key",
      "content": "Steps to rotate the CDN signing key every quarter: generate a new key, publish it, wait for propagation, retire the old key."
    }
